1
00:00:00,551 --> 00:00:02,251
(Sheldon:)But which one of us should be
the party who...

2
00:00:02,253 --> 00:00:03,523
(Howard:)You can do it, Sheldon.

3
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:05,151
So stipulated!

4
00:00:06,958 --> 00:00:09,888
(Leonard:)Once I found a stash
of contracts under his bed.

5
00:00:09,894 --> 00:00:11,424
(Leonard:)It was weird.

6
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:18,296
(Bernadette:)I wonder how much
she spent on this.

7
00:00:18,302 --> 00:00:19,432
(Amy:)Ooh, let's find out.

8
00:00:19,437 --> 00:00:21,207
(Raj:)It doesn't matter.

9
00:00:21,205 --> 00:00:23,275
(Raj:)It's the thought
that counts.

10
00:00:23,274 --> 00:00:24,774
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah,
and beauty's on the inside,

11
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:26,575
(Penny:)size doesn't matter...
how much she spend?

12
00:00:26,577 --> 00:00:29,947
(Raj:)Seriously, guys,
I don't want to know.

13
00:00:29,947 --> 00:00:31,447
(Amy:)Oh, my.

14
00:00:31,449 --> 00:00:34,719
(Raj:)Oh, come on, you can't say
“Oh, my,” and then not tell me!

15
00:00:34,719 --> 00:00:37,819
These things go for $500 and up.

16
00:00:37,822 --> 00:00:39,022
BERNADETTE:
Damn.

17
00:00:39,023 --> 00:00:41,023
(Bernadette:)All I got for Valentine's Day
was a postcard

18
00:00:41,025 --> 00:00:43,755
(Bernadette:)saying my Vermont Teddy Bear
was back-ordered.

19
00:00:43,761 --> 00:00:44,991
PENNY:
Okay, so, she drops off

20
00:00:44,996 --> 00:00:46,366
a $500 gift

21
00:00:46,364 --> 00:00:48,094
(Penny:)and she's not trying to
get back together with you?

22
00:00:48,099 --> 00:00:49,769
(Raj:)Maybe you're right.

23
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:51,997
(Bernadette:)Or she's telling the truth
and just being nice.

24
00:00:52,003 --> 00:00:53,233
(Raj:)Maybe you're right.

25
00:00:53,237 --> 00:00:55,337
(Raj:)Wow, I am easy to manipulate.

26
00:00:55,339 --> 00:00:58,579
(phone chiming)

27
00:00:58,576 --> 00:01:00,646
(Raj:)Oh, guys, it's Emily.

